# invoice_mgmt.func

> Module: invoice_mgmt (Fatura Yönetimi) | Category: FINANCE

## Purpose
Complete invoice lifecycle management: create, send, track payments, generate PDFs, and produce e-Fatura (UBL-TR XML) for Turkish tax compliance. The most feature-rich finance module with 8 API endpoints.

## Problems It Solves
- Turkish logistics companies must issue legal invoices (e-Fatura/e-Arşiv)
- KDV (VAT) calculation at 20% (Turkish rate)
- Tevkifat (withholding tax) support for B2B transactions
- Payment tracking: Taslak → Onayda → Onaylandı → Gönderildi → Ödendi → İptal
- Aging analysis (vade analizi) for overdue collections
- Recurring invoice templates for regular customers

## Technical Database Structure
**Tables:**
- `invoices` — Main invoice records
- `invoice_items` — Line items per invoice
- `invoice_payments` — Payment records
- `e_fatura_logs` — e-Fatura transaction log
- `invoice_recurrences` — Recurring invoice templates

**Key invoice columns:**
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Invoice ID |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| musteri_id | INTEGER FK | Customer |
| fatura_no | VARCHAR(50) | Invoice serial number |
| fatura_tarihi | DATE | Issue date |
| vade_tarihi | DATE | Due date |
| ara_toplam | DECIMAL(12,2) | Subtotal |
| kdv_orani | INTEGER | VAT rate (default 20) |
| kdv_tutari | DECIMAL(12,2) | VAT amount |
| tevkifat_orani | DECIMAL(5,4) | Withholding tax rate |
| tevkifat_tutari | DECIMAL(12,2) | Withholding amount |
| genel_toplam | DECIMAL(12,2) | Grand total |
| odenen_tutar | DECIMAL(12,2) | Paid amount |
| kalan_tutar | DECIMAL(12,2) | Remaining balance |
| durum | invoice_status_enum | Current status |
| e_fatura_uuid | UUID | e-Fatura transaction ID |
| para_birimi | VARCHAR(3) | Currency (TRY/EUR/USD) |

**Enum:** `invoice_status_enum` — Taslak, Onayda, Onaylandı, Gönderildi, Ödendi, İptal

## User Interface
**InvoicesPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/invoices`
- DataGrid table: Fatura No, Müşteri, Tarih, Vade, Ara Toplam, KDV, Genel Toplam, Kalan, Durum
- Status badges with colors (draft=gray, sent=blue, paid=green, cancelled=red)
- Add modal: customer selector, date, due date, line items (description, qty, price)
- Auto-calculation: ara_toplam, KDV (20%), genel_toplam
- PDF download button per invoice
- Payment recording
- Filters by status, customer, date range
- Export to CSV/Excel/PDF

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/invoices/` | Tenant JWT | List invoices |
| GET | `/api/tenant/invoices/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Detail + line items |
| POST | `/api/tenant/invoices/` | Tenant JWT | Create (auto-calc KDV, totals) |
| GET | `/api/tenant/invoices/aging` | Tenant JWT | Aging report |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/invoices/{id}/pay` | Tenant JWT | Record payment |
| POST | `/api/tenant/invoices/{id}/pdf` | Tenant JWT | Generate PDF |
| POST | `/api/tenant/invoices/{id}/e-fatura` | Tenant JWT | Send e-Fatura (UBL-TR XML) |
| GET | `/api/tenant/invoices/recurrences` | Tenant JWT | List recurring templates |
| POST | `/api/tenant/invoices/recurrences` | Tenant JWT | Create recurring template |

